{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/geometry-trigonometry/mensuration/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/geometry-trigonometry/mensuration.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Mensuration — Area & Volume","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<header class=\"bg-amber-600 text-white py-4\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 flex items-center justify-between\">\n      <div class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">Mensuration</div>\n      <a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/geometry-trigonometry/\" class=\"text-sm text-white/90\">Back</a>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto p-6 space-y-6\">\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Key Formulas</h2>\n      <div class=\"mt-3 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-gray-700\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"font-medium\">Circle</div>\n          <div class=\"muted\">Area = πr², Circumference = 2πr</div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"font-medium\">Rectangle</div>\n          <div class=\"muted\">Area = l × w</div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"font-medium\">Triangle</div>\n          <div class=\"muted\">Area = ½ × base × height</div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"font-medium\">Cylinder</div>\n          <div class=\"muted\">Volume = πr²h</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Worked Examples</h2>\n      <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside mt-3 text-gray-700\">\n        <li>Circle radius 7 cm → area = π×7² = 154 cm² (use π≈3.14)</li>\n        <li>Cylinder r=3 cm, h=10 cm → volume = π×9×10 ≈ 282.6 cm³</li>\n      </ol>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Practice</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-4\">\n        <div class=\"p-4 border rounded bg-gray-50\">\n          <div class=\"font-semibold\">1) Circle r = 5 cm. Area?</div>\n          <input id=\"m1\" class=\"mt-3 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 78.5\">\n          <div class=\"mt-3 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"mc1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-600 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"mh1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n          <div id=\"mfb1\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"p-4 border rounded bg-gray-50\">\n          <div class=\"font-semibold\">2) Cylinder r=4, h=8. Volume?</div>\n          <input id=\"m2\" class=\"mt-3 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 402.12\">\n          <div class=\"mt-3 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"mc2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-600 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"mh2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n          <div id=\"mfb2\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"text-right\"><button id=\"msQuiz\" class=\"bg-amber-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded\">Open Quiz</button></div>\n  </main>\n\n  <div id=\"msModal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/40 z-40 flex items-center justify-center\">\n    <div class=\"bg-white rounded p-6 max-w-md w-full\">\n      <div id=\"msContent\"></div>\n      <div class=\"mt-4 text-right\"><button id=\"msClose\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Close</button></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->\n\n\n\n\n      \n\n      <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">Brief solutions</h3>\n      <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside text-gray-700\">\n        <li>V = πr^2h = π·9·5 = 45π.</li>\n        <li>Area = 28.\n        </li>\n      </ol>\n    \n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"bg-amber-50 font-sans","bodyStyle":"","css":[".card { background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1rem; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(2,6,23,0.06); }\n    .muted { color: #6b7280 }"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}